{"id": 907335, "slug": "rennsport", "name": "Rennsport", "name_original": "Rennsport", "description": "<p><strong>RENNSPORT</strong> is the playground car enthusiasts have been waiting for.</p><p>It is a photo-realistic racing simulation offering the highest levels of multiplayer competition. It is where gamers, drivers, pro athletes, modders, and car enthusiasts come together to drive, live, and share their passion for racing and special cars.</p><p>Drive different car classes like <strong>GT3</strong>, <strong>GT4</strong>, <strong>Hypercars</strong>, and more in both single-class and multi-class races.</p><p>Explore the world of racing at iconic locations like <strong>Autodromo Nazionale Monza</strong>, <strong>Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps</strong>, and <strong>Daytona International Speedway</strong>, among others.</p><p>Drive against other players of matching skill in multiplayer races or rise through the ranks in league racing.</p><p>Show the world your skills by dominating the leaderboards in Time Trials, or challenge your friends directly with any car and track combination you can think of.</p><p> </p><p> </p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": null, "tba": true, "updated": "2024-12-20T05:56:45", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/55a/55ac36c489ce5e00c6bfe84f9f3cffdf.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/050/050d45e0efc11cb5660ee71204559225.jpg", "website": "https://www.rennsport.gg/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 9, "added_by_status": {"owned": 4, "toplay": 2, "dropped": 1, "playing": 2}, "playtime": 8, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 40, "parent_achievements_count": 40, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_cou